that I would give you
a moment in the spotlight.

2213
01:14:19,280 --> 01:14:21,440
I actually thought
she was acting suspiciously too.

2214
01:14:23,200 --> 01:14:24,320
Ladies and gentlemen,

2215
01:14:24,720 --> 01:14:26,160
I have brought out

2216
01:14:26,160 --> 01:14:27,040
all the evil in human nature

2217
01:14:27,040 --> 01:14:28,440
on this show.

2218
01:14:36,360 --> 01:14:37,000
Time to cook.

2219
