Twist it open.

2225
01:14:44,940 --> 01:14:46,140
Let the fun begin!

2226
01:14:48,060 --> 01:14:49,660
(Sweet but not too sweet)
Lick it.

2227
01:14:49,660 --> 01:14:50,660
Smooth, creamy filling.

2228
01:14:51,620 --> 01:14:52,620
A sweet sensation!

2229
01:14:54,020 --> 01:14:55,140
Dunk it.

2230
01:14:55,500 --> 01:14:56,380
Take the taste to the next level.

2231
01:14:57,220 --> 01:14:58,060
That works too!

2232
01:14:58,060 --> 01:14:58,900
Unleash your playful side.

2233
01:14:59,060 --> 01:14:59,860
Anything goes!

2234
01:15:00,860 --> 01:15:02,420
100% imported cocoa powder.

2235
01:15:02,580 --> 01:15:03,940
Multiple layers of deliciousness
in every bite.

2236
01:15:04,460 --> 01:15:05,420
Bring along Oreo.

2237
01:15:05,420 --> 01:15:06,860
Let's head out
and have some fun together!

2238
01:15:07,100 --> 01:15:08,340
Oreo, delicious and fun!

2239
01:15:08,900 --> 01:15:09,700
