2240
01:15:18,200 --> 01:15:18,700
(Jia Bing's menu today:
1. Pork and pickled cabbage hot pot)

2241
01:15:18,700 --> 01:15:18,860
That's good.

2242
01:15:18,860 --> 01:15:19,640
(2. Northeastern mixed stew)
That's good.

2243
01:15:19,640 --> 01:15:20,460
(3. Chicken and glass noodle stew
4. Dumplings)

2244
01:15:20,500 --> 01:15:21,580
(Pork and pickled cabbage hot pot)

2245
01:15:21,700 --> 01:15:22,980
(Add the dried seafood
soup base and broth seasoning)

2246
01:15:23,220 --> 01:15:24,540
(Pour in an appropriate amount of water)

2247
01:15:24,580 --> 01:15:25,980
(Add scallions and ginger
to remove any unpleasant odor)

2248
01:15:29,580 --> 01:15:31,900
(Layer the pickled cabbage
at the bottom)

2249
01:15:32,220 --> 01:15:35,340
(Boil the skin-on pork belly
until tender, then slice and set aside)

2250
01:15:36,980 --> 01:15:37,860
(Simmer the pickled cabbage
until golden, then add the rest)

2251
01:15:38,100 --> 01:15:39,220
(Prepare the ingredients
for the dumplings at the same time)

2252
01:15:39,260 --> 01:15:40,380
(Pour boiling water
over half the flour and mix)

2253
01:15:40,380 --> 01:15:41,460
(Add cold water to the remaining flour
to make the dough softer and more elastic)

2254
01:15:43,740 --> 01:15:45,020
(Leave the dough to rest)

2255
01:15:45,580 --> 01:15:49,060
(Finely chop the pork belly, glass noodles,
pickled cabbage, and chives separately)

2256
01:15:50,300 --> 01:15:51,660
(Drizzle scallion-ginger oil
over the filling for flavor and moisture)

2257
01:15:51,700 --> 01:15:52,460
(Once cooled, mix in the scallion-ginger
oil and seasonings)

2258
01:15:55,500 --> 01:15:56,540
(Add soy sauce, seasoned soy sauce,
and oyster sauce. Mix well)

2259
01:15:56,560 --> 01:15:57,520
I am here, Bing.

2260
01:15:57,800 --> 01:15:58,760
What are we making?

2261
01:15:58,760 --> 01:15:59,760
Scallion-braised tofu.

2262
01:15:59,760 --> 01:16:00,920
Scallion-braised tofu? All right.

2263
01:16:00,920 --> 01:16:01,640
I'll help with the prep.

2264
01:16:01,640 --> 01:16:02,340
(One more assistant has joined)

2265
01:16:02,560 --> 01:16:04,000
Bing, give me something to do.

2266
01:16:04,560 --> 01:16:05,720
