in a stew pot?

2719
01:30:30,240 --> 01:30:31,240
I wonder if it's the spatula.

2720
01:30:31,300 --> 01:30:32,780
(I am completely innocent)

2721
01:30:33,320 --> 01:30:34,720
Bing, what are you making?

2722
01:30:34,960 --> 01:30:36,200
A light dish.

2723
01:30:36,200 --> 01:30:37,000
I am cooking some baby napa cabbage.

2724
01:30:37,280 --> 01:30:37,800
Come on.

2725
01:30:39,280 --> 01:30:40,120
I added some

2726
01:30:40,120 --> 01:30:41,560
Totole reduced-sodium chicken seasoning.

2727
01:30:41,560 --> 01:30:43,160
Made with fresh chicken,

2728
01:30:43,160 --> 01:30:44,440
and it contains 25% less salt.

2729
01:30:44,440 --> 01:30:45,320
When it comes to cooking,

2730
01:30:45,320 --> 01:30:45,920
the key is simple.

2731
01:30:45,920 --> 01:30:47,640
It's not about how much salt you use,
but how you bring out the flavor.

2732
01:30:47,640 --> 01:30:48,720
Come and try it.

2733
01:30:49,480 --> 01:30:50,480
This smells wonderful.

2734
01:30:51,640 --> 01:30:52,760
It really brings out the umami flavor.

2735
01:30:53,120 --> 01:30:53,800
Everything's ready now, right?

2736
01:30:53,800 --> 01:30:55,660
(The freestyle stew is ready)
I think my dish is ready to be served.

2737
01:30:56,120 --> 01:30:56,920
Here, birthday boy.

2738
01:30:57,160 --> 01:30:58,600
Please try the stew I made for you.

2739
01:30:59,300 --> 01:31:00,500
The freestyle stew.

