2993
01:39:38,120 --> 01:39:40,080
To all my brothers and sisters,

2994
01:39:40,480 --> 01:39:41,160
I love you all.

2995
01:39:41,160 --> 01:39:41,680
Yeah.

2996
01:39:44,200 --> 01:39:44,760
Beautiful.

2997
