Please welcome Buakaw.

3302
01:51:27,260 --> 01:51:28,460
(And Teng's the lucky one)

3303
01:51:31,180 --> 01:51:32,020
(Copying his moves)

3304
01:51:35,280 --> 01:51:36,480
That look is fierce, Teng.

3305
01:51:36,480 --> 01:51:39,240
Shouldn't Mr. Huang take his place?

3306
01:51:39,240 --> 01:51:40,240
Buakaw!

3307
01:51:41,280 --> 01:51:42,840
Teach him a lesson!

3308
01:51:42,840 --> 01:51:43,840
Every day.

3309
01:51:43,840 --> 01:51:44,520
Okay.

3310
01:51:48,140 --> 01:51:49,900
(Can Mr. Huang beat Thailand's
Muay Thai champion?)

3311
01:51:50,040 --> 01:51:50,920
Hello, everyone!

3312
01:51:51,820 --> 01:51:52,660
(Advanced cooking class begins)

3313
01:51:52,920 --> 01:51:53,440
Come on.

3314
01:51:54,680 --> 01:51:55,280
Come on.

3315
01:51:55,520 --> 01:51:57,200
One, two, three, four!

3316
01:51:58,440 --> 01:51:59,880
Do we have to stir-fry
like that as well?

3317
01:51:59,940 --> 01:52:02,060
(You called it)

3318
01:52:04,240 --> 01:52:05,960
All those ridiculous rumors

3319
01:52:05,960 --> 01:52:08,360
going around the imperial harem lately

3320
01:52:08,360 --> 01:52:10,040
were spread by

3321
01:52:10,040 --> 01:52:10,840
one of you.

3322
01:52:10,840 --> 01:52:12,760
If I may ask one more question,

3323
01:52:12,760 --> 01:52:15,640
(Eunuch Shen has arrived)
were they good or bad rumors?

3324
01:52:15,640 --> 01:52:16,400
This looks like

3325
01:52:16,400 --> 01:52:18,360
a thousand-year-old
Garfield come to life.

3326
01:52:20,480 --> 01:52:21,640
What did you just say about me?

3327
01:52:22,320 --> 01:52:23,880
Anyu framed me.

3328
01:52:25,160 --> 01:52:26,520
Twisting the truth.

3329
01:52:27,680 --> 01:52:29,040
Costume dramas are so fun.

3330
01:52:29,880 --> 01:52:30,760
Look how happy he is.

3331
01:52:30,760 --> 01:52:32,200
I can't take it anymore.

3332
01:52:32,480 --> 01:52:34,560
He hasn't stopped grinning.

3333
01:52:34,760 --> 01:52:35,920
He's just having fun

3334
01:52:35,920 --> 01:52:37,240
without using his brain.

3335
01:52:39,100 --> 01:52:40,520
(Bonus episode preview)
Undercover Werewolf.

3336
01:52:40,520 --> 01:52:41,560
Let's play one more round.

3337
01:52:41,560 --> 01:52:42,720
Infect me.

3338
01:52:42,720 --> 01:52:44,040
I'm not the Killer!
How can I infect you?

3339
01:52:44,100 --> 01:52:44,780
(What's gotten into him?)

3340
01:52:44,880 --> 01:52:45,560
Are you alone?

3341
01:52:46,200 --> 01:52:46,760
You...

3342
01:52:46,760 --> 01:52:47,240
No...

3343
01:52:47,600 --> 01:52:48,880
I'm looking for a chance.

3344
01:52:49,040 --> 01:52:49,480
Hu.

3345
01:52:49,880 --> 01:52:51,360
I just saw Bai and Song

3346
01:52:51,360 --> 01:52:52,320
coming out of there.

3347
01:52:52,320 --> 01:52:53,560
See if Bing's in there.

3348
01:52:53,780 --> 01:52:54,680
(Spots Bing)

3349
01:52:54,680 --> 01:52:55,160
Sound the alarm!

3350
01:52:56,240 --> 01:52:56,640
What?

3351
01:52:57,040 --> 01:52:58,960
I might have a surveillance view again.

3352
01:52:58,960 --> 01:53:00,320
Explain why you're laughing.

3353
01:53:00,320 --> 01:53:01,800
I think I've caught the Killer.

3354
01:53:01,800 --> 01:53:03,360
Why don't you go in and check yourself?

3355
01:53:03,360 --> 01:53:04,840
I can't jump down! It's too high!

3356
01:53:04,840 --> 01:53:05,840
Why are you acting all cutesy?

3357
01:53:05,840 --> 01:53:06,560
It's too high.

3358
01:53:06,720 --> 01:53:08,440
That answer seems suspicious.

3359
01:53:08,440 --> 01:53:09,520
Can't I think it's high?

3360
01:53:09,520 --> 01:53:10,200
On this show,

3361
01:53:10,200 --> 01:53:12,000
you've done bungee jumping
and skydiving.

3362
01:53:12,000 --> 01:53:12,800
Those have ropes!

3363
01:53:12,800 --> 01:53:13,800
(Fun fact: Skydiving requires a rope)

3364
01:53:13,800 --> 01:53:15,120
Fine, I'm voting for you.

3365
01:53:16,080 --> 01:53:17,440
I saw those two

3366
01:53:17,440 --> 01:53:19,840
coming out of the murder room.

3367
01:53:19,840 --> 01:53:20,520
And you're voting for me?

3368
01:53:20,600 --> 01:53:21,480
Jingyu is eliminated.

3369
01:53:22,960 --> 01:53:23,480
Continue.

3370
01:53:26,040 --> 01:53:28,040
Jingyu's definitely suspicious.

3371
01:53:28,040 --> 01:53:29,800
Jingyu's been eliminated!

3372
01:53:29,800 --> 01:53:31,830
(Snap out of it)
What's wrong with you?

3373
01:53:31,840 --> 01:53:32,800
He's a ghost.

3374
01:53:32,800 --> 01:53:34,240
I forgot who we just eliminated.

3375
01:53:34,440 --> 01:53:35,860
(Just taking a lovely stroll)
He's just wandering around.

3376
01:53:35,900 --> 01:53:37,780
(Undercover Werewolf:
Bonus round coming up)

3377
01:53:37,780 --> 01:53:59,020
(Natural High S4 viewing calendar)
